{"steam_appid":562360,"steam_name":"Planes, Bullets and Vodka","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/562360/83003/e3193b5010a5bbb11ced3df963ed75a848fb75ca/1751302142/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1704292886","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256676010/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1704292886","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/ss_8ec8a0b405d50be04689389c37b790ce8b750fce.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762262867","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/ss_f9ed6b528815b1296ee9456d79236b45fc191904.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762262867","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/ss_e7e027fef6909558b3628f06779e36230f797fd5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762262867","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/ss_a24a8ba5df8843645f1ff961486c170009e9b53c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762262867","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/ss_747764599ada91b02ca10e8cbfa840c460b7a6af.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762262867"],"about_the_game":"<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fly through danger filled procedurally generated tunnels, avoiding thousands of enemies, on this throwback to the golden age of arcade games. </li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/extras/ee90ebd635f6289dd76d9364f9dd8410.poster.avif?t=1762262867\" width=590 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/extras/ee90ebd635f6289dd76d9364f9dd8410.webm?t=1762262867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/extras/ee90ebd635f6289dd76d9364f9dd8410.mp4?t=1762262867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Perfect to play when you are in a queue for another game or when you want to get your name on the top of a leaderboards. This is a small, re-playable game, the objectives included are to beat your best score, to get on the leaderboards and get achievements.<br></li><li>Inspired by timeless classics like River Raid, 1942, Space Invaders, Truxton, and Galaga, it offers a unstopable action with thousands of bullets and enemies at each run!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/extras/826cd7d3da2496180fb8730ad429bf91.poster.avif?t=1762262867\" width=588 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/extras/826cd7d3da2496180fb8730ad429bf91.webm?t=1762262867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/extras/826cd7d3da2496180fb8730ad429bf91.mp4?t=1762262867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Survive as long as possible avoiding walls and enemies, on a increasingly difficult game. <br></li><li>Get biggers scores by not missing enemies, for every 10 kill your multiplier increases, if 1 enemy pass, the multiplies return to 0.<br></li><li>The difficulty is constantly rising, so destroy the enemies early to get a bigger score.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/extras/cf293b98cd26b37f8af6fd03cb8053eb.poster.avif?t=1762262867\" width=590 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/extras/cf293b98cd26b37f8af6fd03cb8053eb.webm?t=1762262867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/562360/extras/cf293b98cd26b37f8af6fd03cb8053eb.mp4?t=1762262867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft® Windows® XP or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.0 GHZ or Better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Compatible with DirectX 9<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft® Windows® 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 3.0 GHZ or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Compatible with DirectX 9 or later<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["NukGames"],"publishers":["NukGames"],"release_date":"13 Dec, 2016"}